    {
      "n": "Chuck E. Live Stage (Dance Floor) + Video Wall",
      "s": "2023-03-29",
      "e": "0000-00-00",
      "desc": "2021 Model. Also, this is the first Corporate store to remodel to 2.0 not because of damage to the store (Birmingham, AL (500 Old Town Rd) got 2.0 because of flood damage and Sheffield was remodeled to 2.0 under the choice of the store's Franchisee). 2nd location to undergo a full 2.0 exterior remodel (Sheffield yet again kept the logo from it's previous remodel)"
